%[output:3a76a1b7]
%   data: {"dataType":"text","outputData":{"text":"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t% Mesh Analysis using Kirchhoff's Laws\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRmat = [1320 -220   0;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t    -220  231  -1;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t    0   -1  201];\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tV = [12; 0; 3];\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tI = Rmat \\ V;   % [i1; i2; i3] in A\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\ti1 = I(1);\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\ti2 = I(2);\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\ti3 = I(3);\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfprintf('i1 = %.6f A\\n', i1);\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfprintf('i2 = %.6f A\\n', i2);\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tfprintf('i3 = %.6f A\\n', i3);\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t","truncated":false}}
